    "_doc": "Frozen Lake (region 3). center/radius = ice ellipse in world metres. holes = ice-fishing holes. A hole gives catchesMin..Max fish, then freezes and needs iceHits axe hits. Orca: rises under a hero standing on the ice, telegraphs 'breaches' red circles, breaks the ice there (open water for waterSeconds), then surfaces for surfaceSeconds — the only time it can be hit.",
